<section class="sec alt rvl" id="itx-faq">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="sechead">
<div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--violet)">Questions people ask</div>
<h2>Phone battery replacement FAQ</h2>
</div>
<div class="faq" id="itx-faqlist">
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="true">How long does a battery replacement take? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>Most phone batteries are replaced in 20 to 40 minutes while you wait. Book ahead for less common models so the right battery is ready.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="false">Do you replace iPhone batteries? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>Yes. We replace batteries in iPhones, as well as Samsung, Google Pixel and other Android phones, at both our Bloomsbury and Moorgate shops.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="false">Do I need an appointment? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>No. Walk in to Bloomsbury or Moorgate any day of the week. Booking is optional.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="false">Will I lose my data? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>No. A battery replacement doesn't affect your photos, messages or apps. A backup beforehand is always sensible.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="false">My battery is swollen. Is it safe to bring in? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>Yes, and the sooner the better. Stop charging the phone, switch it off, keep it away from heat, and bring it to either shop. Don't try to press the case back together.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="false">Do you use genuine parts? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>We fit genuine replacement batteries and high-quality batteries that meet or exceed the original specification, tested before and after fitting.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q"><button aria-expanded="false">Is there a warranty? <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
<div class="a"><div><p>Yes. Every repair carries a warranty on the part and the labour. The period depends on the repair, and we confirm it before any work starts.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:18px">More detail: <a href="/guide-to-phone-battery-replacement-uk/">our guide to phone battery replacement</a>, <a href="/why-is-my-phone-battery-draining/">why your phone battery is draining</a> and <a href="/iphone-battery-health-not-showing/">iPhone battery health not showing</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
